        "description": "Community statement relayed by the owner on 2026-09-05, recorded in docs/research/sdd/COMMUNITY_NOTES.md: the car has two physical medium-speed buses, BO_MSCAN (body) and CO_MSCAN (comfort); neither reaches J1962 pins 3 and 11 directly; the central gateway — GWM, or CJB/BCM — joins them and relays or switches the tester's diagnostic requests to the BO or CO branch; HS_CAN is on pins 6 and 14",
        "document_page": null,
        "document_section": "Bus topology of the 2014-and-later cars, stated 2026-09-05",
        "record_key": "BO_MSCAN CO_MSCAN",
        "capture_timestamp_us": null
      },
      "excerpt": "BO_MSCAN and CO_MSCAN behind the gateway on pins 3/11; HS_CAN on pins 6/14",
      "notes": "A statement without a cited document or measurement; its source is being asked for. Whether the gateway relays transparently or switches per request is not settled by it."
    }
